!Sample_description = Drop-seq
!Sample_data_processing = Demultiplexed fastq files were cleaned of reads not passing the Illumina Passing Filter with fastq_illumina_filter (version 0.1) and processed with the Drop-seq Tools (version 2.3.0) pipeline
!Sample_data_processing = Count matrices were processed with the R package Seurat (version 4,1), data were integrated across samples with the R package Harmony (version 0.1.1).
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: comma-separated matrix and metadata files
